B. Best-of-N: does one GRPO sample beat a perfect best-of-48?
==========================================================================
  Claim WITHDRAWN. Also withdrawn: firr10/fir40 'existence failures'.
  Runs analyze_bestofn.py on the 30-design set and greps its table.

  fir40_8b   SFT bo48 =   181.7   GRPO bo1 =    94.7   -> SFT wins
  firr10     SFT bo48 =   313.2   GRPO bo1 =   300.7   -> SFT wins
  extrap: perfect bo48 = 170.4 MHz, GRPO bo1 = 138.6 MHz  -> GRPO does NOT beat bo48
  interp: perfect bo48 = 210.3 MHz, GRPO bo1 = 198.7 MHz  -> GRPO does NOT beat bo48

  Expected: GRPO does NOT beat bo48 in either regime, and SFT wins
  on both firr10 and fir40 -- which is why 'existence failure' went.

